 first draft is always sent back for revision. Revise it:\\nLisbon is the capital of Portugal located on the Tagus estuary and is famously known as the oldest city in Western Europe. The city currently enjoys a pleasant 21\\u00b0C with clear skies and typically features a Mediterranean climate with mild winters and warm summers.\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"\\n\\n<memory>\\n<entry source=\\\"notes\\\">Lisbon is the capital of Portugal located on the Tagus estuary and typically enjoys a Mediterranean climate with mild winters and warm summers.</entry>\\n</memory>\"}]}]" ;
