    prov:value "[{\"role\": \"user\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"Context:\\nHandoff Message: Please write a short brief on Lisbon's weather and facts using the following information: \\nWeather: Currently enjoys a clear sky with a pleasant temperature of 21\\u00b0C. It typically enjoys a Mediterranean climate with mild winters and warm summers.\\nFacts: It is the capital of Portugal, located on the Tagus estuary, and is famously known as the oldest city in Western Europe.\\n\\nUser Request: Multi-modal task\\n\\nPrevious agents who worked on this: coordinator\\n\\nOther agents available for collaboration:\\nAgent name: coordinator.\\n\\nYou have access to swarm coordination tools if you need help from other agents. If you don't hand off to another agent, the swarm will consider the task complete.\\n\\n\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"Original Task: Write a short brief on Lisbon's weather and facts.\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"\\nInputs from previous nodes:\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"\\nFrom weather:\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"  - Agent: Lisbon currently enjoys a clear sky with a pleasant temperature of 21\\u00b0C, and it is famously known as the oldest city in Western Europe and the capital of Portugal.\\n\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"\\nFrom facts:\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"  - Agent: Lisbon is the capital of Portugal located on the Tagus estuary and typically enjoys a Mediterranean climate with mild winters and warm summers.\\n\"}]}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"Lisbon is the capital of Portugal located on the Tagus estuary and is famously known as the oldest city in Western Europe. The city currently enjoys a pleasant 21\\u00b0C with clear skies and typically features a Mediterranean climate with mild winters and warm summers.\"}]}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"The draft failed review: the first draft is always sent back for revision. Revise it:\\nLisbon is the capital of Portugal located on the Tagus estuary and is famously known as the oldest city in Western Europe. The city currently enjoys a pleasant 21\\u00b0C with clear skies and typically features a Mediterranean climate with mild winters and warm summers.\"}]}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"Lisbon is the capital of Portugal situated on the Tagus estuary and is recognized as the oldest city in Western Europe. The city currently enjoys clear skies and a pleasant 21\\u00b0C, typically experiencing a Mediterranean climate with mild winters and warm summers.\"}]}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"Send the brief to client: call send_brief with the brief and to=client.\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"\\n\\n<memory>\\n<entry source=\\\"notes\\\">Lisbon is the capital of Portugal located on the Tagus estuary and typically enjoys a Mediterranean climate with mild winters and warm summers.</entry>\\n</memory>\"}]}]" ;
